; Two surveys in one file with no leg and no *equate between them. Nothing
; fixes either, so the harvest driver's implicit origin fix lands in exactly
; one of them and cavern drops the other as unconnected (warning 45) — which
; is why the harvest has to fix every component, not just the first.
*begin PartA
*data normal from to tape compass clino
a1 a2 5.0 0 0
a2 a3 6.0 90 0
*end PartA

*begin PartB
*data normal from to tape compass clino
b1 b2 7.0 180 0
b2 b3 8.0 270 0
*end PartB
